	"description": "Accessible chess for NVDA, for all ages.\nPlay against the computer (10 levels, powered by the Stockfish engine) or against another person on the same computer, with the whole board readable by speech and braille. Includes Learn to play, a guided 23-lesson course also designed for children; 5,000 real puzzles from Lichess that adapt to your level; an optional clock; games saved in PGN format; and your statistics.\nThe Learn to play course is currently available in Spanish only.",
